    <briefdescription>
<para>Exponentially Weighted Moving Average covariance estimator. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Computes variance using exponential smoothing: variance_t = alpha * (x_t - mean_t)^2 + (1-alpha) * variance_{t-1}</para>
<para>Adapts continuously with O(1) memory. Alpha controls responsiveness:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Higher alpha (0.1): Fast adaptation, more sensitivity</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Lower alpha (0.01): Slow adaptation, smoother estimates </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
